From 9f632343bbe8075465bbda72d667222d19dc649c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GianFadiga <gianluccafadigarissato@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 20:36:47 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Turn indicators: optional automatic blinkers together with
 manual ones (TURNINDICATORS.AutoWithManual)

With ManualTurnIndicators on, the automatic steering-based blinkers were switched off entirely.
AutoWithManual (default 0, editor-only like ManualTurnIndicators) keeps them running while no blinker or
hazard was switched on by hand; a manual blinker takes priority until the player switches it off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J2EEBdczaXVKRDjePb6ox8
